  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Style",
      "text": "**为 DeepSeek Harness 复刻 Claude Code Desktop 风格与交互体验的主题插件。**\n\n> **你的下一个 Claude Code Desktop ，何必是Claude Code。**\n\n[](README.md) [](README.en.md)\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-claude-style)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-claude-style)\n[](https://github.com/Nwflower/dsh-claude-style)\n[](https://www.dsh.so/artifact/dsh-claude-style/)\n[](LICENSE)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "预览",
      "text": "两套主题在插件设置里切换，亮暗跟随系统。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Claude",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-home-light.png\" alt=\"Claude 档编程首页 —— 亮色\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-home-dark.png\" alt=\"Claude 档编程首页 —— 暗色\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-conversation-light.png\" alt=\"Claude 档 Markdown 对话 —— 亮色\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-conversation-dark.png\" alt=\"Claude 档 Markdown 对话 —— 暗色\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Claude",
      "text": "> 编程首页（上），对话界面（下）；浅色在左，深色在右。"
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-home-light.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek 档编程首页 —— 亮色\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-home-dark.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek 档编程首页 —— 暗色\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-conversation-light.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek 档 Markdown 对话 —— 亮色\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-conversation-dark.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek 档 Markdown 对话 —— 暗色\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/idle.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"空闲\" /><br />空闲</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/thinking.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"思考\" /><br />思考</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/typing.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"写回答、调用工具\" /><br />写回答、调用工具</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/conducting.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"指挥子代理\" /><br />指挥子代理</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/notification.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"等你操作\" /><br />等你操作</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/error.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"失败\" /><br />失败</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/happy.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"完成\" /><br />完成</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/sleeping.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"睡着\" /><br />睡着</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "> 吉祥物也可在设置里切换成像素螃蟹 Clawd 或像素鲸娘。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "官方插件页添加这个包名，或从终端安装：\n\n```\ndsh-claude-style\n```\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-claude-style                    # npm 包（推荐）\ndsh plugin --profile web add Nwflower/dsh-claude-style#dist      # GitHub 发布分支\n```\n\n也可从[插件市场](https://github.com/dsh-market/dsh-market)或 dsh-web-all 的皮肤中心安装。同一时刻只启用一个主题；需要 dsh ≥ 0.2.2-rc.1，装好后重启 DeepSeek Harness。"
    },
    {
      "section": "手动未读标记",
      "text": "在会话的省略号菜单中选择「标记为未读」或「清除未读标记」。标记保存在当前配置中，刷新页面后保留，切走后再次打开该会话时清除；宿主的自动完成提醒保持独立。"
    },
    {
      "section": "撤回与编辑消息",
      "text": "指针移到你自己发出的消息上，时间与复制按钮旁边会多出「撤回」与「编辑」。两者都打开一个新会话，原会话原样保留：撤回把这条消息和它之后的对话切掉，把原文放回输入框等你重新发送；编辑先在气泡的位置改好文字，确认后直接在新会话里发出。带图片或文件附件的消息不给这两个按钮，附件没法随文字搬进新会话。这一轮还在进行时，两个按钮会先等它停下。可在插件设置的「对话」标签页关闭此功能。"
    },
    {
      "section": "字体",
      "text": "> Anthropic 没有公开发行这三款字体；本仓库只提供下载与研究的[副本](https://github.com/Nwflower/dsh-claude-style/tree/master/packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic)。\n\n启用时二选一：装进系统，或把 `.ttf` 复制到 `$DSH_HOME/dsh-claude-style/fonts/`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "文档",
      "text": "| 文档 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| [设计令牌](docs/STYLE.md) | 配色、字体、形状、动效与层级 |\n| [架构决策](docs/adr/README.md) | 每条方向一页：背景、决定、后果与重审条件 |\n| [更新日志](docs/CHANGELOG.md) | 版本历史 |\n| [贡献指南](CONTRIBUTING.md) | 构建、提交规范与回归工具 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "除特别说明，本仓库以 MIT 授权。\n\n钠（Sodium）渲染引擎以 [PolyForm Shield 1.0.0](packages/client/src/features/sodium/LICENSE) 授权。"
    },
    {
      "section": "鸣谢",
      "text": "- 「钠 / Sodium」取名自 Minecraft 的 [Sodium](https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium) 渲染优化模组，本插件与它没有关联。\n- 消息导航参考 SherUnlocked-4869 的 [dsh-plugin-msg-nav](https://github.com/SherUnlocked-4869/dsh-plugin-msg-nav)（MIT）。\n- Deepy 和鲸鱼娘的动画帧图来自 calmly-eating-bugs（[@wp3171216237](https://github.com/wp3171216237)）绘制的主题包。\n- 聊天区的增强动效改自 [dsh-chat-ux](https://github.com/alm-allen/dsh-chat-ux)（MIT）。\n- Clawd是 Anthropic 的角色形象。帧图不适用 MIT 许可（见 [LICENSE](LICENSE)）。本插件是非官方爱好者作品，与 Anthropic 没有关联。"
    },
    {
      "section": "友链",
      "text": "> 想把 Claude Code / Codex 等外部代理的会话历史导入 DSH 接着聊？推荐作者的另一个插件 [dsh-chat-import](https://github.com/Nwflower/dsh-chat-import)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Star History",
      "text": "[](https://star-history.com/#Nwflower/dsh-claude-style&Date)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Style",
      "text": "**A theme plugin that brings the look and feel of Claude Code Desktop to the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI.**\n\n> **Why settle for another Claude Code when your next Claude Code Desktop is here.**\n\n[](README.en.md) [](README.md)\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-claude-style)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-claude-style)\n[](https://github.com/Nwflower/dsh-claude-style)\n[](https://www.dsh.so/artifact/dsh-claude-style/)\n[](LICENSE)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Preview",
      "text": "The settings page switches between the two palettes; light and dark follow the system."
    },
    {
      "section": "Claude",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-home-light.png\" alt=\"Claude brand, Code home — light\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-home-dark.png\" alt=\"Claude brand, Code home — dark\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-conversation-light.png\" alt=\"Claude brand, Markdown conversation — light\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/claude-conversation-dark.png\" alt=\"Claude brand, Markdown conversation — dark\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Claude",
      "text": "> Code home above, Markdown conversation below; light on the left, dark on the right. White canvas `#FFFFFF` with a `#FAFAFA` sidebar, near-black `#191919` with a `#1F1F1F` sidebar, ember orange `#D97757` for every action, and Claude Code's pixel crab on the composer."
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-home-light.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek brand, Code home — light\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-home-dark.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek brand, Code home — dark\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-conversation-light.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek brand, Markdown conversation — light\" /></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"./docs/screenshots/deepseek-conversation-dark.png\" alt=\"DeepSeek brand, Markdown conversation — dark\" /></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "> Pale blue-white canvas `#FBFCFF` with a `#F7F9FF` sidebar, blue-black `#13161D`, DeepSeek blue `#4D6BFE`; Deepy the pixel whale stands on the composer, in eight states:"
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/idle.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Idle\" /><br />Idle</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/thinking.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Thinking\" /><br />Thinking</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/typing.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Answering and calling tools\" /><br />Answering and calling tools</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/conducting.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Conducting subagents\" /><br />Conducting subagents</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/notification.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Waiting on you\" /><br />Waiting on you</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/error.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Failed\" /><br />Failed</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/happy.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Finished\" /><br />Finished</td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"25%\"><img src=\"./docs/gifs/sleeping.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Asleep\" /><br />Asleep</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DeepSeek",
      "text": "> In Settings the mascot can also be switched to the pixel crab Clawd or the whale girl.\n\n> The workspaces, sessions, usage figures and nickname in the screenshots are sample data."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "From the official plugin page add the package below, or from a terminal:\n\n```\ndsh-claude-style\n```\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-claude-style                    # npm package (recommended)\ndsh plugin --profile web add Nwflower/dsh-claude-style#dist      # GitHub release branch\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "Also from the [plugin market](https://github.com/dsh-market/dsh-market) or the Skin Center of the dsh-web-all plugin. Keep one theme enabled at a time; dsh ≥ 0.2.2-rc.1 is required, and a restart of DeepSeek Harness brings the full feature set."
    },
    {
      "section": "Manual unread marks",
      "text": "Choose **Mark as unread** or **Clear unread mark** from a session's ellipsis menu. Marks are saved in the current profile, survive reloads, and clear when you leave and later open that session. The host's automatic completion reminders stay independent."
    },
    {
      "section": "Retract and edit a message",
      "text": "Hover a message you sent and **Retract** and **Edit** join the clock and copy buttons. Both open a new session and leave the original as it was: retracting drops that message and everything after it and puts the text back in the composer for you to send again, while editing amends the text in place first and sends it in the new session as soon as you confirm. A message carrying images or files gets neither button, since attachments cannot travel with the text into a new session. Both wait while the turn is still running. Disable the feature under **Conversation** in the plugin settings."
    },
    {
      "section": "Fonts",
      "text": "> The Anthropic fonts have no public release; this repository only offers [copies](https://github.com/Nwflower/dsh-claude-style/tree/master/packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic) for download and study.\n\nTo enable them, install the `.ttf` files on your system, or copy them into `$DSH_HOME/dsh-claude-style/fonts/`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Documentation",
      "text": "| Document | Contents |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Design tokens](docs/STYLE.md) | The palette, typography, shape, motion and layer rules |\n| [Architecture decisions](docs/adr/README.md) | One page per direction: background, decision, consequences, revisiting conditions |\n| [Changelog](docs/CHANGELOG.md) | Version history |\n| [Contributing](CONTRIBUTING.md) | Building from `packages/client/src/`, commit conventions, and the screenshot and regression tooling |"
    },
